# Financial Immutability Rule

Confirmed financial records must not be silently edited or hard-deleted.

Corrections must use controlled adjustment, reversal, refund, chargeback, or versioning workflows defined by the specification.

Original successful payments remain preserved. Refund/dispute/chargeback state lives on linked adjustment records, not by rewriting success.

Do not regenerate a historical invoice PDF from today's mutable company/invoice data when an immutable stored version exists.

Authoritative docs: `docs/Modules/Invoices.md`, `docs/Modules/Payments.md`, `docs/Modules/Refunds Disputes Chargebacks.md`, `docs/Foundation/Business Rules.md`.
